      {
        "id": "C14",
        "kind": "assumption",
        "title": "Name: keep 'dlog' as placeholder",
        "body": "PENDING OWNER CONFIRMATION - not decided. Source: PROJECT.md Open decisions 1. 'dlog' is a working name. Recommendation: decide before the first public use; it does not block v1 internals. Alternatives: none listed in PROJECT.md (gap).",
        "status": "active",
        "reason": "",
        "successor": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "C15",
        "kind": "assumption",
        "title": "Runtime: Python 3.11+ standard library only",
        "body": "PENDING OWNER CONFIRMATION - not decided. Source: Open decisions 2 and Stack recommendation. Recommendation: Python 3.11+ stdlib only (argparse, pathlib, json, tomllib for reading), matching the stdlib-first preference; tests with unittest. Alternative: Go single static binary - easier to hand to headless agents/machines without Python, at the cost of a second toolchain.",
        "status": "active",
        "reason": "",
        "successor": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "C16",
        "kind": "assumption",
        "title": "Record format: Markdown body + TOML frontmatter",
        "body": "PENDING OWNER CONFIRMATION - not decided. Source: Open decisions 3. Recommendation: Markdown body with TOML frontmatter, read with tomllib, written by a minimal hand-written emitter covering only the field types dlog uses. Alternatives: Markdown with JSON frontmatter; pure JSON or TOML files.",
        "status": "active",
        "reason": "",
        "successor": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "C17",
        "kind": "assumption",
